her relief, nobody looked at her in surprise. "Good!"

55
00:05:01.576 --> 00:05:08.614
she thought. "My meld medallion is working." A

56
00:05:08.615 --> 00:05:15.425
waitress handed her a menu. "Only one seat is left at the counter." Ally

57
00:05:15.426 --> 00:05:18.963
sat down and opened the menu. She

58
00:05:18.964 --> 00:05:27.369
wanted to use her meld medallion to translate it, but the waitress was watching her closely. "I'll

59
00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:31.126
just have one of everything!" Ally blurted out. "You

60
00:05:31.127 --> 00:05:35.238
got enough money? That'll cost hundreds of dollars." "Dollars?"

61
00:05:35.239 --> 00:05:42.297
Ally shook her head. "I don't have any of those." The waitress

62
00:05:42.298 --> 00:05:49.663
took the menu back. "Sorry, no handouts." Ally was

63
00:05:49.664 --> 00:05:56.940
